{"id":"porto","name":"波尔图","en":"Porto","country":"Portugal","lat":41.15,"lng":-8.6108,"dek":"杜罗河入海处，一座以波特酒命名的北方城市","history":"波尔图早在公元四世纪已有人居住，作为商业港口而兴起，其名即含“港口”之意。五世纪建城，后因七世纪的外来入侵和战乱趋于没落。十二世纪起，城市逐步形成上城文化区与下城商业区的格局。葡萄牙王国从莱昂王国独立后，波尔图成为王国中心地区之一。\n\n十四至十五世纪，伴随大航海时代的到来，波尔图发展为造船港口。杜罗河谷出产的葡萄酒在此集散售卖，为日后波特酒贸易打下基础。1703年葡萄牙与英国签订条约，双边贸易关系的建立进一步推动了波特酒的产销体系。\n\n1910年代，蔡元培曾在此居住。二十世纪以来，波尔图经济持续发展，成为葡萄牙西北部重要的经济中心。其旧城区与周围产酒区被列为世界文化遗产。","culture":"波尔图的城市性格里有一种沉实的北方气质。老城街巷狭窄而错落，建筑表面常覆有青花瓷砖，杜罗河从城南流过，对岸加亚新城的酒窖与河上的铁桥构成天界线。河岸一带的里贝拉区保留着旧时码头生活痕迹，小餐馆临河而开，傍晚时本地人与游客混坐，气氛直接而松弛。\n\n这座城市与波特酒的关系几乎是血脉性的。葡萄牙国名源自波尔图，波特酒的名字亦然。葡萄酒并非只在酒窖中被谈论，它也渗透在日常饮食、节庆与贸易记忆里。河对岸的酒窖延续着存放与调配的工序，而城区里的大小餐馆则有另一种更平民的联结，如牛肚、盐渍鳕鱼和以啤酒相配的三明治。","pull":"酒从杜罗河来，城市与河共同命名了葡萄牙。","sights":[{"name":"证券交易所宫","orig":"Palácio da Bolsa","intro":"建于19世纪，位于圣方济各会教堂旧修道院基础上。内部有葡萄牙著名的阿拉伯厅，装饰繁复精美。建筑本身即是波尔图商业历史的展示，也提供波特酒品鉴空间。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Palacio_da_Bolsa_%28Porto%29.JPG/960px-Palacio_da_Bolsa_%28Porto%29.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E6%89%80%E5%AE%AB_(%E6%B3%A2%E5%B0%94%E5%9B%BE)"},{"name":"波尔图主教座堂","orig":"Sé do Porto","intro":"始建于13世纪的罗曼式教堂，17至18世纪经过巴洛克式改造。坐落在高地之上，从教堂前可以俯瞰城市层层叠叠的屋顶与杜罗河。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Fachada_da_S%C3%A9_do_Porto.jpg/960px-Fachada_da_S%C3%A9_do_Porto.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1013},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%A2%E5%B0%94%E5%9B%BE%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99%E5%BA%A7%E5%A0%82"},{"name":"莱罗书店","orig":"Livraria Lello","intro":"一间老书店，以新哥特式木雕、彩绘天花和红色螺旋楼梯闻名。空间不大但细节繁密，常被列入欧洲最漂亮书店的名单。门票可抵扣购书费用。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/A_Livraria_Lello_e_Irm%C3%A3o-A_ponte_de_encanto.jpg/960px-A_Livraria_Lello_e_Irm%C3%A3o-A_ponte_de_encanto.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1501},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%90%8A%E7%BE%85%E6%9B%B8%E5%BA%97"},{"name":"克莱瑞科塔","orig":"Torre dos Clérigos","intro":"巴洛克风格钟楼，登上塔顶需走226级台阶。塔身是波尔图天际线中最易辨认的标记之一，顶部的视野覆盖老城、河岸与对岸酒窖区。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Torre_de_los_Cl%C3%A9rigos%2C_Oporto%2C_Portugal%2C_2012-05-09%2C_DD_01.JPG/960px-Torre_de_los_Cl%C3%A9rigos%2C_Oporto%2C_Portugal%2C_2012-05-09%2C_DD_01.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1882},"src":null},{"name":"里贝拉河岸","orig":"Ribeira","intro":"杜罗河北岸的老码头区，房屋紧贴河岸，色彩斑驳。窄巷里开着家庭餐馆和小酒馆，河上可见路易一世大桥。入夜后河面映出对岸灯火，气氛松弛。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/Panorama_Ribera.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":370},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8C%E8%B4%9D%E6%8B%89"}],"foods":[{"name":"波尔图式牛肚","orig":"Tripas à moda do Porto","intro":"以白豆、牛肚和各种肉类炖煮的浓菜。波尔图人被称为“吃牛肚的人”，即源于此菜。传统餐馆常作正餐供应，热食，味厚。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Tripas_%288907365960%29.jpg/960px-Tripas_%288907365960%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":717},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tripas_%C3%A0_moda_do_Porto"},{"name":"玛格丽特三明治","orig":"Francesinha","intro":"多层肉类夹入烤面包，外覆奶酪和微辣酱汁，可加薯条。这是波尔图的标志性食物，当地人认为应配啤酒而非葡萄酒。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Francesinha_Sandwich_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Francesinha_Sandwich_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":550},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francesinha"},{"name":"盐渍鳕鱼","orig":"Bacalhau","intro":"葡萄牙最常见的食材之一，可烤、煮、煎或与马铃薯、洋葱同做。波尔图餐馆里做法多样，是日常饮食的核心。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Klippfisk.jpg/960px-Klippfisk.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1280},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A6%AC%E4%BB%8B%E4%BC%91"},{"name":"波特酒","orig":"Vinho do Porto","intro":"产自杜罗河谷的加强型葡萄酒，因波尔图得名。酒体多甜，餐后小杯慢饮。对岸加亚新城的酒窖提供归类与品饮。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Port_wine.jpg/960px-Port_wine.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%A2%E7%89%B9%E9%85%92"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Historical_part_of_Porto%2C_Portugal.jpg/1280px-Historical_part_of_Porto%2C_Portugal.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":646},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Ayuntamiento_de_Oporto%2C_Portugal%2C_2012-05-09%2C_DD_03.JPG/1280px-Ayuntamiento_de_Oporto%2C_Portugal%2C_2012-05-09%2C_DD_03.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":908}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-8.691289,41.1687516],[-8.6902618,41.1682271],[-8.6905196,41.1667492],[-8.6862528,41.1628492],[-8.686488,41.1601483],[-8.6850269,41.1582893],[-8.6855796,41.1576724],[-8.6844762,41.1586026],[-8.6835709,41.1577586],[-8.6842098,41.1574128],[-8.6820974,41.1566568],[-8.6749272,41.1478094],[-8.677407,41.1466789],[-8.6746385,41.1472923],[-8.6764405,41.1468372],[-8.6798343,41.1448218],[-8.6745427,41.146996],[-8.6707481,41.1434745],[-8.6610299,41.1428056],[-8.6479869,41.1462518],[-8.639072,41.1474684],[-8.6298132,41.1441425],[-8.6256548,41.1436134],[-8.6197046,41.1398428],[-8.6156035,41.138902],[-8.600871,41.1412024],[-8.5941835,41.1383507],[-8.5889949,41.1396367],[-8.5849783,41.1421532],[-8.5820928,41.142424],[-8.577905,41.1418914],[-8.5757632,41.1399579],[-8.5738805,41.1423049],[-8.5730643,41.1416975],[-8.5725677,41.1429541],[-8.5717499,41.1424872],[-8.5694835,41.1439878],[-8.5700119,41.1454294],[-8.569